{"version":1,"id":"topic-breaking-me","title":"Breaking Me","artist":"Topic","key":"G#m","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/topic/breaking-me/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Topic 92, A7s, Molly Isabelle Irvine and Rene Mueller","chords":[{"symbol":"G#m","canonical":"G#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[8,11,3],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"F#","canonical":"F#","keyboardPitchClasses":[6,10,1],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"E","canonical":"E","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,8,11],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"section","text":"[Primeira Parte]","columns":16,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"Call me what you wanna, I'll be what you wanna","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"I've been here a thousand times, eh-eh","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":17,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"Fallin' for another, I don't even bother","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"I could do it all my life","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":14,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"section","text":"[Pré-Refrão]","columns":12,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"So tell me if you wanna 'cause I got this feeling","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":18,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"I wanna hear you say it 'cause I can't believe it","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":17,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"With every touch of you, it's like I've started dreaming","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":20,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"Guess heaven's not that far away","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":24,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"And I'll be singing, la-la-la-la, la-la-la-la","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":21,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"You're breaking me, la-la-la-la, la-la-la-la","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":20,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"You're breaking me, la-la-la-la, la-la-la-la","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":20,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"You're breaking me, la-la-la-la, la-la-la-la","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":20,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm just right here dancing around to the rhythm","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":20,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"The rhythm that you play when you're breaking my heart","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":20,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"You know that I can't get you out of my system","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":22,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"Yeah, right from the start, you played with my heart","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":21,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"And I'll be singing, la-la-la-la, la-la-la-la","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":21,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"You're breaking me, la-la-la-la, la-la-la-la","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":20,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"You're breaking me, la-la-la-la, la-la-la-la","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":20,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"You're breaking me, la-la-la-l